# Allowlist, not a blocklist: Claude writes credentials, transcripts, plugin
# caches and session state into this directory, and a new one appearing later
# must not become a surprise commit. Everything is ignored; add an exception
# only for a file that genuinely belongs in version control.
*
!.gitignore
!settings.json
!statusline-command.sh
!speech/
speech/*
!speech/speak.py
!speech/play-queue.sh
